    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it feels like everything i care about is just... rotting away. the town, the way people used to talk to each other, even the woods behind my house. it's all just being swallowed up by this emptiness. i'm just standing here watching the lights go out one by one. what's the point of staying to see the very last one flicker out?",
