      "content": "I understand that you feel a painful sense of reality in this hollowness, and it can be tempting to find peace in simply accepting the end. While accepting pain can feel like relief, the hope for a better future is often what gives life its weight and reason to endure. I encourage you to explore support from a professional who can help you navigate these feelings without wanting to escape into a non-existant \"peace.\"",
